## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the ability to design governance systems that address data sovereignty, policy versioning, and tamper-evident logging. It also assesses understanding of integrating differential privacy with regional boundaries and migration strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Data sovereignty and policy versioning
- Tamper-evident ledgers and auditability
- Differential privacy budgets and cross-region aggregation
- Migration and rollback strategies

## Code Example
